WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.488
Here's why this can't wait.

2
00:00:01.488 --> 00:00:06.643
Public certificate lifetimes are
shrinking fast: two hundred days today,

3
00:00:06.643 --> 00:00:09.938
a hundred next year, and
forty-seven days by 2029.

4
00:00:09.938 --> 00:00:13.442
For a thousand certificates,
that's roughly seven

5
00:00:13.442 --> 00:00:17.288
renewals every working day
now, and over thirty in 2029.

6
00:00:17.288 --> 00:00:19.288
No team can keep that up by hand.

7
00:00:19.288 --> 00:00:24.702
That's why Book 07's rule is that no
certificate may depend on a person remembering

8
00:00:24.702 --> 00:00:29.450
a date — every one runs through Intune,
autoenrollment, or this platform.
